@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fixed the temporary directories created by the :fixture:`tmpdir`,
+:fixture:`tmpdir_factory` and :fixture:`tmp_path_factory` fixtures when the
+current user name contains characters which are not allowed in directory names,
+for example ``domain\user`` on Windows.
